WEBVTT

00:53.094 --> 00:55.597
10:15 on a Saturday night

00:57.348 --> 01:02.270
And the tap drips under the striplight

01:04.314 --> 01:06.816
And I'm sitting in the kitchen sink

01:09.861 --> 01:12.489
And the tap drips
Drip, drip, drip, drip

01:12.572 --> 01:14.699
Drip, drip, drip, drip, drip, drip

01:41.518 --> 01:42.352
D?

01:42.894 --> 01:44.687
When'd you sneak back in?

01:45.355 --> 01:46.481
Hello?

01:48.650 --> 01:49.567
Don't be dead.

01:52.153 --> 01:53.321
Is it morning?

01:53.947 --> 01:54.906
Uh-huh.

01:56.407 --> 01:58.409
But I... The nightmares.

01:59.410 --> 02:01.246
Roman! I didn't dream!

02:01.329 --> 02:03.123
D! Stop it! You're freaking me...

02:04.666 --> 02:06.626
You reek.

02:08.878 --> 02:11.256
'Kay... my ass is clean.

02:11.339 --> 02:12.549
Get my head.

02:13.758 --> 02:15.468
When was your last shower?

02:15.552 --> 02:16.678
Huh...

02:16.761 --> 02:17.971
Lemme see now.

02:18.054 --> 02:20.723
Never mind. Don't answer that.

02:23.309 --> 02:26.437
Most restful morning
I've had in a long while.

02:26.521 --> 02:30.024
So, about yesterday.
It started when you found that shard.

02:30.525 --> 02:31.609
Uh-huh.

02:31.693 --> 02:33.236
Can you still do that stuff?

02:33.820 --> 02:34.988
Good question.

02:40.034 --> 02:42.453
Walk. Walk.

02:42.954 --> 02:44.914
Walk. Walk.

02:44.998 --> 02:46.749
- Hey, you were rolling, right?
- Walk.

02:50.086 --> 02:52.505
Yeah, that sure does
look like me, doesn't it?

02:52.589 --> 02:54.549
What do you mean? Course it was you.

02:55.425 --> 02:56.676
- And that girl.
- Huh?

02:57.427 --> 02:58.511
What girl?

02:58.595 --> 03:01.222
Y'know. Bright red, kinda floatin' around?

03:01.306 --> 03:03.725
Bright red? What does that even mean?

03:03.808 --> 03:05.518
Yep. Red as a barn.

03:05.602 --> 03:08.521
Yeah, but what part?
Her hair? Skin? Clothes?

03:08.605 --> 03:10.732
- All of it!
- All of it?

03:11.232 --> 03:14.068
And there were
these glitchy sparky thingies.

03:14.152 --> 03:17.363
A girl that's red all over
with sparky thingies?

03:18.114 --> 03:19.699
Well... that's right.

03:19.782 --> 03:21.284
Cam caught some odd flares.

03:21.367 --> 03:22.911
But the girl?

03:23.536 --> 03:25.205
Choom, she doesn't exist.

03:25.288 --> 03:28.374
She does!
The bitch tried to take over my body!

03:28.875 --> 03:31.878
Sure that shard's
not carryin' a neurovirus?

03:31.961 --> 03:34.297
Should probably yank the thing out. Whoa!

03:34.380 --> 03:37.258
Except viruses are supposed
to weaken systems and slow you down!

03:37.342 --> 03:38.927
The exact opposite of this!

03:39.010 --> 03:40.136
I mean, yeah, I guess.

03:40.720 --> 03:43.681
Whatever she did to me, it felt good.

03:43.765 --> 03:45.475
Like I was a kid again.

03:45.558 --> 03:46.893
Like a kid?

03:48.019 --> 03:49.270
Oh, wait, wait, wait!

03:49.771 --> 03:50.647
What is it?

03:50.730 --> 03:52.482
Ugh, the glare.

03:52.565 --> 03:54.651
You looked so happy here, too.

03:55.443 --> 03:58.238
- I was happy?
- Mmm. Dang it.

04:01.574 --> 04:03.368
- D.
- Mmm?

04:03.910 --> 04:06.537
- You gotta yank the shard.
- No way! Why should I?

04:06.621 --> 04:08.039
It's all kinds of bad news!

04:08.122 --> 04:09.958
What more reason do you need?

04:10.041 --> 04:11.793
Said yourself it tried to hijack you.

04:11.876 --> 04:13.419
And you just said I was happy!

04:13.503 --> 04:16.547
So what if you were?
Doesn't mean that thing is safe.

04:19.550 --> 04:23.304
- It's her!
- Hey, now! Don't "her" me, buddy!

04:23.388 --> 04:25.974
Just call me Capri!

04:26.057 --> 04:28.977
Wait. Me? Us? He?

04:29.060 --> 04:30.728
- She? They? We?
- D?

04:30.812 --> 04:32.230
Eh, whatever!

04:32.313 --> 04:34.899
Are you saying she's here? The red girl?

04:34.983 --> 04:37.568
Oh? It's the baby from yesterday!

04:37.652 --> 04:39.112
Hi, little baby!

04:39.195 --> 04:40.530
She's saying hi.

04:40.613 --> 04:42.490
Uh, hi.

04:42.573 --> 04:43.700
What a sweetie-pie.

04:43.783 --> 04:45.243
- You hear that?
- Not a thing.

04:45.326 --> 04:46.494
Or you see that?

04:46.577 --> 04:47.787
Nope.

04:48.579 --> 04:52.500
Nobody can hear me,
nobody can see me. Nobody besides you.

04:52.583 --> 04:54.585
Just what the hell are you, exactly?

04:54.669 --> 04:56.337
What does that matter?

04:56.421 --> 04:58.673
C'mon, let's be friends.

04:58.756 --> 05:01.092
- Gah! Fuck off!
- Hmm.

05:01.175 --> 05:03.720
Friends don't try to hijack
each other's bodies!

05:03.803 --> 05:06.472
- Why? Is that bad?
- Yes!

05:06.556 --> 05:10.226
Just 'cause I tried
doesn't mean I actually did.

05:10.810 --> 05:11.728
Not yet.

05:12.312 --> 05:13.229
Not yet?

05:13.313 --> 05:16.858
Naw, c'mon! Yesterday was so much fun!

05:16.941 --> 05:19.235
- I know you thought so too!
- No, I didn't!

05:19.319 --> 05:21.446
Who are you tryna haze?

05:21.529 --> 05:24.866
We're sharing the same
pink and squishy CPU.

05:24.949 --> 05:27.493
I know if I was havin' a total blast,

05:27.577 --> 05:29.620
it means you had to be, too.

05:29.704 --> 05:31.622
What the hell are you?

05:31.706 --> 05:33.374
Me? I'm Capri.

05:33.458 --> 05:34.917
That's not what I asked.

05:35.001 --> 05:37.795
Oh, you mean, what the hell am I?

05:37.879 --> 05:39.255
Jesus Chr... Ugh.

05:39.339 --> 05:40.923
Isn't that what I just said?

05:41.007 --> 05:42.884
Oh! Wait a minute!

05:42.967 --> 05:43.801
Huh?

05:43.885 --> 05:46.012
Even if I can't see her, that's fine.

05:46.095 --> 05:48.139
But maybe we can patch
her voice through?

05:49.766 --> 05:50.975
Huh?

05:53.311 --> 05:55.313
- Hmm?
- Hah-hah! Hah!

05:57.732 --> 05:58.566
Whoa!

06:00.902 --> 06:04.322
All right. I'm a personality construct.

06:04.906 --> 06:06.199
A construct?

06:06.282 --> 06:08.951
In my case,
a collection of human psyches.

06:09.035 --> 06:12.830
All of them digitized
and rolled into one beautiful me.

06:12.914 --> 06:14.749
So you're an AI?

06:14.832 --> 06:16.459
Are all mammals dogs?

06:16.542 --> 06:19.587
No. AIs got too powerful.
Outgrew the leash.

06:19.670 --> 06:22.465
But their corporate masters
still wanted that power.

06:22.548 --> 06:26.677
So they created me.
Powerful, like an AI, but born of humans.

06:26.761 --> 06:29.055
So very many humans!

06:29.138 --> 06:32.600
You're a weapon?
A weapon made out of people?

06:33.184 --> 06:35.353
Eh. Close enough.

06:35.436 --> 06:38.606
A force the likes of which
the world has never seen!

06:38.689 --> 06:42.360
The trick was finding the right
Joe Schmo or Jane Schlane to stick me in.

06:42.443 --> 06:44.404
You need a human host to run?

06:44.487 --> 06:47.281
Uh-huh! After all,
what good is an operating system

06:47.365 --> 06:49.117
without a computer to operate?

06:49.826 --> 06:51.869
And I was compatible.

06:51.953 --> 06:53.454
Sure looks that way.

06:53.538 --> 06:54.914
Lemme get this straight.

06:54.997 --> 06:58.042
If you'd been successful takin' over
after landin' in my head,

06:58.126 --> 07:00.044
I would've been overwritten, right?

07:00.128 --> 07:01.879
But the install failed somehow.

07:01.963 --> 07:04.799
It's incomplete,
leaving you anchored to this chip.

07:04.882 --> 07:08.761
So, if I yank it,
you get sucked back into your cage?

07:08.845 --> 07:09.929
Mm-hmm.

07:10.430 --> 07:11.514
- Relax.
- Huh?

07:11.597 --> 07:14.016
I'm willing to let you ride shotgun.

07:14.100 --> 07:17.520
But in return, you're gonna share
that power of yours with me.

07:17.603 --> 07:20.022
Assumin' you're not outta tricks.

07:24.402 --> 07:26.028
Her prognosis is clear.

07:26.112 --> 07:29.115
Continued heavy use
and implantation of cyberware

07:29.198 --> 07:32.660
places your daughter
at high risk of acute cyberpsychosis.

07:32.743 --> 07:36.539
We were led to believe that
Talia possesses exceptional tolerance.

07:36.622 --> 07:40.585
The fact that she's remained
stable thus far is exceptional in itself.

07:40.668 --> 07:43.671
Just days ago, you saw no early markers.

07:43.754 --> 07:47.425
Symptoms can be subtle,
heterogenous across individuals,

07:47.508 --> 07:49.218
or even absent altogether.

07:49.302 --> 07:52.430
The pool of diagnostic data
for this disease is limited.

07:52.513 --> 07:55.099
But due to the severity
of Talia 's symptoms,

07:55.183 --> 07:59.187
we were able to confirm her diagnosis
prior to any onset of psychosis.

07:59.270 --> 08:02.398
She's a valuable specimen
for future study.

08:02.482 --> 08:04.150
Specimen?

08:04.233 --> 08:05.693
- Sorry?
- Nothing.

08:06.319 --> 08:08.738
Please send me a full report
of your findings.

08:09.780 --> 08:12.241
I'd also like second and third opinions.

08:12.325 --> 08:14.243
Oh. Of course.

08:14.994 --> 08:18.664
By the way,
why are you still hangin' around?

08:18.748 --> 08:20.374
D. Seriously?

08:20.458 --> 08:22.210
You don't gotta tag along anymore.

08:22.293 --> 08:25.421
What? You drag me back and forth,
all over the city,

08:25.505 --> 08:28.591
and then you ditch me the moment
you slot a new choom into your head?

08:28.674 --> 08:31.469
As I recall, your sole aim was
to scroll Maelstrom.

08:31.552 --> 08:32.929
That was just biz.

08:33.513 --> 08:35.932
What I really want is to film you, D.

08:36.015 --> 08:37.808
Me? Why?

08:37.892 --> 08:40.311
Got this feeling
you'll leap off the screen.

08:40.394 --> 08:42.063
The hell's that even mean?

08:42.730 --> 08:45.942
Anyway, can't stroll into Arasaka
with a kid.

08:46.025 --> 08:48.569
Says the guy
clearly scared of goin' himself.

08:48.653 --> 08:51.072
I am not. Smart-ass.

08:51.656 --> 08:54.408
If your stupid butt can get in, so can I.

09:06.170 --> 09:07.797
Whoa.

09:15.054 --> 09:16.055
Which way?

09:16.973 --> 09:18.015
Follow me.

09:23.062 --> 09:25.523
It's like we really are invisible.

09:26.857 --> 09:29.193
Mighty nifty system breach.

09:31.237 --> 09:32.613
Nicely done.

09:35.324 --> 09:39.328
She says there's only a single soul
in Data Archive B right now.

09:43.958 --> 09:45.001
Hmm?

09:46.085 --> 09:47.169
You there!

09:47.837 --> 09:49.422
This is a restricted are--

09:50.089 --> 09:52.133
Mind answering me a few questions?

09:52.216 --> 09:54.552
I do and I won't. This is my office.

09:54.635 --> 09:56.887
Not whatever gutter you crawled out from.

09:56.971 --> 09:58.514
What are you doing, boy?

09:58.598 --> 09:59.807
Filming.

09:59.890 --> 10:01.267
On corporate property?

10:01.350 --> 10:03.394
- Child or not, there are consequ--
- Two years ago.

10:03.477 --> 10:06.689
Saka and Maelstrom.
They hit one of Snake Nation's clans.

10:06.772 --> 10:08.399
and burned the whole camp to ashes.

10:08.482 --> 10:11.152
Who was pulling the strings?

10:11.235 --> 10:12.486
Are you...

10:12.987 --> 10:14.655
Wait a sec. Do you fuckin' know me?

10:14.739 --> 10:16.741
I said no such thing.

10:17.658 --> 10:20.244
Yeah, whatever.
Just gimme all the files on it.

10:20.328 --> 10:21.203
I will not.

10:21.287 --> 10:23.331
I'm this close to blowin'
your fuckin' head clean off.

10:23.414 --> 10:26.459
So do it. If you have the nerve.

10:31.047 --> 10:32.923
Gimme the damn files!

10:34.884 --> 10:35.760
As I thought!

10:35.843 --> 10:37.219
The hell's so funny?

10:37.303 --> 10:39.388
Petty netrunner thief.

10:39.472 --> 10:42.475
You lack conviction to pull the trigger.

10:45.061 --> 10:47.188
The files!

10:47.271 --> 10:50.775
I... refuse.

10:50.858 --> 10:52.985
- Okay! My turn.
- Huh?

10:55.029 --> 10:56.405
Aah!

10:56.489 --> 10:57.948
Couldn't have led with that?

10:58.032 --> 11:00.242
How? That's not possible.

11:03.871 --> 11:05.247
Grab a few winks.

11:05.331 --> 11:07.083
You gotta go easy on him, D.

11:07.667 --> 11:09.293
What if he has Trauma Team?

11:09.794 --> 11:11.295
I did go easy.

11:11.796 --> 11:13.506
He'll wake up in--

11:15.925 --> 11:17.551
Close that right now.

11:17.635 --> 11:19.136
The still? Sure.

11:20.596 --> 11:23.140
What I need's a full list of names.

11:23.224 --> 11:25.142
- No can do.
- Why?

11:25.226 --> 11:27.061
'Cause it doesn't exist.

11:27.144 --> 11:28.312
Can't be right.

11:28.396 --> 11:30.064
So what's the next best thing?

11:30.147 --> 11:32.983
I don't know. It looks like
they scarfed the juicy bites already.

11:33.067 --> 11:34.694
They cleaned house.

11:34.777 --> 11:36.070
There's gotta be somethin'.

11:36.153 --> 11:40.574
Well, might be traces of some lazy deletes
that I could try to undelete.

11:40.658 --> 11:41.784
Get on it, then.

11:41.867 --> 11:43.035
Yessir!

11:47.498 --> 11:50.042
- David Martinez.
- Huh?

11:50.126 --> 11:52.044
That's him, right?

11:53.713 --> 11:55.339
What the hell is this?

11:55.423 --> 11:58.300
David... Martinez.

11:58.384 --> 12:01.220
Rotten edgerunner piece of trash.

12:01.303 --> 12:06.934
How pathetic to think a gang of gutter
rats could push Arasaka to its limits.

12:07.017 --> 12:11.772
And now security can't even stop children
from strolling in off the curb.

12:11.856 --> 12:13.816
What a joke we--

12:13.899 --> 12:16.402
I know you know names.
So gimme the biggest.

12:16.485 --> 12:18.696
- Beats me.
- Bullshit!

12:19.989 --> 12:23.701
You recognized me earlier. Didn't you?

12:23.784 --> 12:26.829
[man Oh, please. You're nobody.

12:26.912 --> 12:30.082
Nobodies don't have
their faces in classified files.

12:31.167 --> 12:32.752
What's the point?

12:33.252 --> 12:35.588
They shuttered the project.

12:35.671 --> 12:38.424
Project? What project?

12:38.507 --> 12:40.134
You're wasting your time.

12:40.217 --> 12:42.303
The truth will always evade you.

12:42.386 --> 12:44.054
Fuck that!

12:44.138 --> 12:46.849
You came here looking for blood,
didn't you?

12:50.019 --> 12:51.353
Why're you laughing?

12:51.437 --> 12:53.355
- Huh?
- Because it tickles me.

12:53.439 --> 12:57.485
This vengeance you sorely seek
but will never find.

12:57.568 --> 12:58.778
Speak plainly!

12:58.861 --> 13:00.321
You gnawed your way in

13:00.404 --> 13:04.575
believing a lone termite could topple
the mighty house of Arasaka.

13:04.658 --> 13:08.913
But that belief will kill you,
the same as it killed Martinez.

13:08.996 --> 13:12.875
The insignificant die
as the insignificant deserve.

13:12.958 --> 13:15.169
Maybe. But I can take you with me.

13:15.252 --> 13:16.378
Huh?

13:16.462 --> 13:17.797
Then do it!

13:17.880 --> 13:20.382
My career won't survive the day anyway.

13:22.009 --> 13:24.345
D! You'll call Trauma!

13:30.476 --> 13:32.520
Still breathin'.

13:32.603 --> 13:35.564
But I bet that tripped an alert.
We gotta go.

13:35.648 --> 13:36.524
Run away?

13:36.607 --> 13:40.402
Unless you wanna scrap it out with TT
on Arasaka turf, we gotta move!

13:40.486 --> 13:42.404
Fuck.

13:45.950 --> 13:47.409
Huh?

13:47.910 --> 13:48.786
Hmm?

13:49.495 --> 13:50.496
Talia?

13:51.497 --> 13:53.290
- C'mon!
- Right.

14:01.257 --> 14:04.552
How are things?
How's your daughter Talia?

14:04.635 --> 14:08.556
Doing well. Aside from a bad case
of teenage rebellion, of course.

14:08.639 --> 14:10.933
She is at that age, isn't she?

14:11.016 --> 14:12.184
Yes.

14:12.268 --> 14:14.937
She's had more implants installed, I hear.

14:15.020 --> 14:17.606
Yes, but she's adapting well.

14:17.690 --> 14:18.691
Is that so?

14:18.774 --> 14:21.151
According to the report I received,

14:21.235 --> 14:24.530
another surgery could cause
a full psychotic break.

14:24.613 --> 14:26.949
No, sir. That's an exaggeration.

14:27.032 --> 14:29.451
The incident has been blown
way out of proportion.

14:29.535 --> 14:31.704
She's been otherwise stable.

14:32.288 --> 14:34.748
Then why neglect to report it yourself?

14:35.291 --> 14:37.251
Secrets rot trust, Kiril.

14:37.334 --> 14:40.212
Trust already damaged
by your loss of the chip.

14:40.296 --> 14:42.840
Yes, sir. I apologize again for that.

14:42.923 --> 14:46.218
The mercenary I hired
had come highly recommended.

14:46.302 --> 14:48.429
You hired a goon from the streets.

14:48.512 --> 14:51.432
In any case,
it's Arasaka that vexes me now.

14:51.515 --> 14:53.100
They aren't scrambling.

14:53.183 --> 14:56.854
They've scarcely mobilized
to retrieve this prized chip of theirs.

14:56.937 --> 15:00.316
In fact, I hear
they intend to abandon it entirely.

15:00.399 --> 15:03.944
I suspect that's a bluff
to create this very kind of doubt.

15:04.028 --> 15:06.864
Maybe. But Arasaka can no longer afford

15:06.947 --> 15:09.825
the luxury of nuance and clever ploys.

15:09.909 --> 15:12.077
Their house is cracking
at its foundations.

15:12.161 --> 15:14.872
Their stranglehold on the city has broken.

15:14.955 --> 15:16.415
That is undeniable.

15:16.498 --> 15:17.625
True.

15:17.708 --> 15:20.085
With Arasaka's influence
already on the wane,

15:20.169 --> 15:23.964
leadership is losing interest
in seizing the project outright.

15:24.048 --> 15:27.092
Should the chip fall into our laps, fantastic.

15:27.176 --> 15:31.597
Should it get dragged down and buried
beneath the sinking ship of Arasaka,

15:31.680 --> 15:33.265
that too is acceptable.

15:33.349 --> 15:36.518
No matter the outcome,
Kang Tao stands to win.

15:36.602 --> 15:37.603
I understand.

15:37.686 --> 15:39.271
That being said, Kiril,

15:39.355 --> 15:42.441
you owe your standing
in the company to this initiative.

15:42.524 --> 15:43.609
Yes, sir.

15:43.692 --> 15:46.111
So squeeze it for all it's worth.

15:46.612 --> 15:48.781
There are still victories to be won here.

15:48.864 --> 15:51.742
Prove I was right to see potential in you.

15:52.326 --> 15:53.619
You have my word.

15:54.203 --> 15:58.248
Well, then, the next time we meet,
I'll expect to see results as promised.

15:58.874 --> 16:00.125
You'll have them, sir.

16:06.757 --> 16:07.633
Weak!

16:08.217 --> 16:09.760
She okay? Talia?

16:09.843 --> 16:13.764
I told the hospital to keep
a close watch on her. I was clear.

16:13.847 --> 16:17.726
She ran off? Knowing she might pop...
go psycho any minute?

16:18.978 --> 16:20.521
You haven't told her yet?

16:20.604 --> 16:22.147
Someone's gotta talk to her.

16:22.231 --> 16:23.774
Don't you do it! Not yet.

16:23.857 --> 16:26.360
You put that thought in her head,
get her worrying about it,

16:26.443 --> 16:28.195
could be what sets the girl off.

16:28.278 --> 16:30.280
What ifs, what ifs. Can't worry about 'em.

16:30.364 --> 16:31.281
Course I can!

16:31.365 --> 16:34.535
We got no idea what might
cause another episode. Or worse!

16:34.618 --> 16:36.704
You don't understand how fragile she is!

16:36.787 --> 16:38.455
Well, uh... I do, I do.

16:38.539 --> 16:41.875
- Then don't talk like that!
- Right, right. Wasn't thinkin'.

16:41.959 --> 16:43.544
Better get movin'. Gotta go.

16:43.627 --> 16:45.087
Gonna get her home to you soon.

16:45.170 --> 16:48.549
Please hurry, Weak.
What if those gang freaks have her?

16:49.216 --> 16:52.428
Yeah... Not too worried about that.

17:02.688 --> 17:04.231
Thought I'd find you here.

17:04.732 --> 17:06.608
Looks like they ditched ya.

17:08.027 --> 17:09.820
And sounds like you blame me.

17:10.362 --> 17:12.072
They're prob'ly just fuckin' around.

17:12.156 --> 17:16.952
C'mon. You don't buy into their cult
bullshit, so why risk your life?

17:17.036 --> 17:18.787
Talking like you know me.

17:19.288 --> 17:21.415
They're pretty touchy about outsiders.

17:21.498 --> 17:23.917
- Prob'ly saw right through ya.
- The hell do you know--

17:24.001 --> 17:27.504
'Sall right. I know you don't chip
all that chrome out of love for it.

17:27.588 --> 17:29.798
That for you, it's a matter of survival.

17:31.175 --> 17:34.720
Sorry. Your mom told me about it.
Your condition.

17:34.803 --> 17:36.180
Okay. So?

17:36.847 --> 17:38.432
Come on. Let's grab a tight bite.

17:38.515 --> 17:39.683
What?

17:39.767 --> 17:41.810
Shoot the shit over some SCOP dogs.

17:41.894 --> 17:43.812
And why the hell would I do that?

17:43.896 --> 17:47.232
So I don't drag your ass
back to the hospital.

17:47.316 --> 17:48.901
Leave the choice to you.

17:52.321 --> 17:56.075
Hey. Heard you went psycho. That true?

17:56.158 --> 17:58.077
It is.

17:58.160 --> 18:02.581
And you're the one to lecture me
on healthy chippin' habits? That's rich.

18:02.664 --> 18:05.334
No one more qualified,
for just that reason.

18:08.170 --> 18:10.506
Got more in common than ya think.

18:10.589 --> 18:13.258
Know exactly what's been
goin' through your mind.

18:13.342 --> 18:15.594
That's almost funny.

18:15.677 --> 18:17.346
We have nothing in common.

18:17.930 --> 18:21.141
Lemme guess, you think
you've got a high tolerance for chrome.

18:21.225 --> 18:23.393
That you're different. Special.

18:23.477 --> 18:26.105
More you chip, the more you feel like you.

18:26.188 --> 18:27.439
So did I.

18:27.523 --> 18:29.650
Except look how you turned out.

18:29.733 --> 18:33.320
That's my point.
You're not special. No one is.

18:33.403 --> 18:34.863
You're wrong.

18:34.947 --> 18:36.907
A lot of people have thought that.

18:36.990 --> 18:38.867
Believed they were just wired different.

18:38.951 --> 18:42.371
But every single one of 'em
either went spiralin' over the edge

18:42.454 --> 18:44.915
or flatlined before they had the chance.

18:44.998 --> 18:48.377
Sooner or later. Just a matter of time.

18:48.460 --> 18:49.753
What am I supposed to do?

18:49.837 --> 18:52.464
Hold on to the last ganic bits I got left?

18:52.548 --> 18:54.299
Fragile and failing?

18:54.383 --> 18:57.052
Chrome's the only thing
still giving me any hope.

18:57.136 --> 18:59.555
You don't know if I'll go psycho.
You can't know.

18:59.638 --> 19:01.682
But if I stop now, I'm dead for sure!

19:01.765 --> 19:04.768
Really expect me
to just curl up and croak?

19:05.352 --> 19:07.479
Oh! Whoa. Uh...

19:10.566 --> 19:13.026
Yeah, so maybe I do go psycho.

19:13.110 --> 19:16.238
Maybe. But even that's better
than definitely dying.

19:16.321 --> 19:17.739
No! It's not!

19:17.823 --> 19:19.116
Not at all.

19:19.199 --> 19:23.203
Most just think of the violence.
The tics, the rage, the outbursts.

19:23.287 --> 19:25.497
But what's worse is you stop being you.

19:26.123 --> 19:27.499
Losing yourself...

19:27.583 --> 19:29.501
That's worse than death.

19:31.336 --> 19:32.754
So what are you saying?

19:32.838 --> 19:35.757
Better I die now? Get it over with?

19:35.841 --> 19:37.509
No. Course not.

19:38.093 --> 19:40.512
But to go through that...

19:40.596 --> 19:43.849
Friends, family. No one's really safe.

19:43.932 --> 19:46.643
Could kill somebody you love
and not remember it.

19:46.727 --> 19:48.270
Not know why.

19:49.688 --> 19:50.981
Did you?

19:51.064 --> 19:52.399
I don't know.

19:52.482 --> 19:53.734
You don't know?

19:53.817 --> 19:56.028
That's what I'm sayin'. It's a blur.

19:56.111 --> 19:57.905
Faces, places, time.

19:57.988 --> 20:01.283
You dont know when
or where you are anymore.

20:01.366 --> 20:03.118
Don't know who you are.

20:03.202 --> 20:05.370
Like, you see old memories?

20:05.454 --> 20:06.496
Uh...

20:07.039 --> 20:08.040
That's rough.

20:10.626 --> 20:13.629
So, if there's a chance
I might hurt someone,

20:13.712 --> 20:16.423
I should prob'ly stay away
from my parents, yeah?

20:16.506 --> 20:18.926
You mean run away and live on your own?

20:19.009 --> 20:21.136
Pretty childish idea, don't ya think?

20:21.220 --> 20:22.471
- You're one to talk.
- Uh...

20:22.554 --> 20:25.015
- Bet you live alone.
- Well, that's different.

20:25.098 --> 20:27.559
Uh-huh. Why're you so involved, anyway?

20:27.643 --> 20:29.519
'Cause my mom asked nicely?

20:29.603 --> 20:31.271
Or, don't tell me.

20:31.355 --> 20:32.606
An affair?

20:32.689 --> 20:34.483
How dare you talk
about your mother that way?

20:34.566 --> 20:37.778
She's a good woman!
She'd never do something like that.

20:37.861 --> 20:39.988
All you need to know is
the two of us go way back,

20:40.072 --> 20:41.490
and she's very special to me.

20:41.573 --> 20:43.909
But, like, romantically? Or...

20:43.992 --> 20:46.703
C'mon! What the hell
are you grillin' my ass for?

20:46.787 --> 20:48.664
The relationship that we have...

20:48.747 --> 20:50.123
Mmm...

20:50.207 --> 20:52.709
Well, it's kinda hard to explain to a kid.

20:53.919 --> 20:56.672
I'm serious. Some things
you learn with age.

20:56.755 --> 20:58.632
Maturity comes with experience.

20:58.715 --> 21:00.425
- Uh...
- Maturity, huh?

21:00.926 --> 21:03.845
Been hung up on
the same woman for, what, decades?

21:03.929 --> 21:05.514
And never moved on?

21:05.597 --> 21:07.933
That's not maturity. That's pathetic.

21:10.435 --> 21:12.813
Uh...

21:13.689 --> 21:15.774
You really gonna critique my love life?

21:15.857 --> 21:17.818
If you had one, I would.

21:18.318 --> 21:21.405
Think you know love
from readin' teen magazines?

21:21.488 --> 21:24.408
- 'Scuse me?
- Sure like to talk a big game, don'tcha?

21:24.491 --> 21:26.576
For someone who hasn't
moved past hand-holdin'.

21:26.660 --> 21:29.288
- You tryna die?
- Hey, it's not your fault--

21:32.040 --> 21:33.292
Uh... Ohh.

21:33.375 --> 21:34.418
I'm callin' him.

21:34.501 --> 21:36.253
- Huh?
- My boyfriend.

21:36.837 --> 21:39.256
Wanna meet him? I'll call him right now.

21:39.339 --> 21:41.300
Whoa. Wait!

21:47.764 --> 21:49.558
- You lookin' for somethin'?
- Hmm?

21:50.225 --> 21:52.394
If it's clouds, I think you're in luck.

21:56.315 --> 21:58.650
- Satellites?
- Huh?

21:58.734 --> 22:00.277
Why satellites?

22:03.196 --> 22:04.614
The hell's so funny?

22:06.408 --> 22:08.869
Shoulda kept a cooler head, D.

22:08.952 --> 22:10.120
Hmm.

22:10.203 --> 22:11.955
I get how you feel, but...

22:12.039 --> 22:13.915
Look who's gettin' lectured by a baby!

22:13.999 --> 22:15.167
Shut up.

22:15.751 --> 22:17.252
Was that aimed at me, or...

22:17.336 --> 22:18.628
Capri.

22:18.712 --> 22:20.047
That's the girl?

22:20.130 --> 22:21.923
She says that's her name.

22:22.007 --> 22:23.592
Capri, huh?

22:23.675 --> 22:25.218
Nice to meet ya, Capri.

22:25.302 --> 22:26.678
Little to the right.

22:28.388 --> 22:30.640
And there's really no way I can see her?

22:31.266 --> 22:32.893
Maybe a flash?

22:34.269 --> 22:35.812
I think I saw somethin'.

22:35.896 --> 22:37.689
Let's see. Check it.

22:40.275 --> 22:41.193
Whoa!

22:41.276 --> 22:42.986
Yeah, that's her!

22:43.779 --> 22:46.448
It's like one of those paranormal shows.

22:46.531 --> 22:48.450
No ghost is that goofy-lookin'?

22:48.533 --> 22:49.993
I think I look spooky.

22:51.161 --> 22:52.704
- Hmm?
- Huh? Talia?

22:57.793 --> 22:58.710
Uh, now?

22:58.794 --> 23:00.045
Please and thanks.

23:00.128 --> 23:02.130
Gah!

23:02.214 --> 23:04.674
Really let your friend
push you around like that?

23:04.758 --> 23:06.593
- Like you're one to talk.
- Oooh!

23:07.135 --> 23:08.512
Wait...

23:08.595 --> 23:10.222
Hey! You snooped!

23:10.305 --> 23:12.933
Ugh! Not cool, choom.

23:14.267 --> 23:16.061
So, do you wanna come along?

23:16.144 --> 23:18.480
I'll pass. She sounds scary.

23:18.980 --> 23:21.691
You know, she was on that list too.

23:21.775 --> 23:23.360
With you and David Martinez.

23:23.443 --> 23:24.486
- What?
- Huh?

23:24.569 --> 23:28.949
Even if we don't understand what
it means, you're all connected somehow.

23:29.032 --> 23:30.909
What we're missin', she might know.

23:31.410 --> 23:34.162
Martinez and I have fuck all in common.

23:34.246 --> 23:36.081
Then why are you on the same list?

23:36.665 --> 23:38.500
There has to be a reason.

23:38.583 --> 23:39.709
Hmph.

23:40.335 --> 23:42.087
'Kay, I'll go alone.

23:43.171 --> 23:45.006
Your dead end just found new life.

23:45.882 --> 23:47.509
Why stop now?

23:48.343 --> 23:49.344
Fine.

23:49.970 --> 23:51.179
I'll join ya.

23:52.431 --> 23:53.640
Who's he?

23:53.723 --> 23:56.017
Uh... 'S my choom D.

23:56.518 --> 23:58.645
D, this is Talia.

23:58.728 --> 24:00.188
What's up?

24:00.272 --> 24:01.773
And, uh, this is Weak.

24:01.857 --> 24:04.151
He's my mom's friend, I guess.

24:06.528 --> 24:08.238
Hmm. Hmm.

24:08.321 --> 24:10.407
You gotta be kidding! It's this one?

24:10.490 --> 24:12.951
- Yep.
- But he's just a kid.

24:13.034 --> 24:15.787
No! He's my boyfriend.

24:15.871 --> 24:18.790
So wipe that stupid grin
off your face and stop being an asshole!

24:19.958 --> 24:22.294
- That's pretty rude, old man.
- See?

24:22.377 --> 24:23.670
This choom gets it.

24:25.672 --> 24:27.007
Oh!

24:27.966 --> 24:29.509
D!

24:35.348 --> 24:39.269
See me, don'tcha? I know you can!

24:44.024 --> 24:45.275
Finally!

24:46.318 --> 24:48.153
I found you!

25:03.418 --> 25:06.171
Didn't mean to sound arrogant

25:06.254 --> 25:10.634
Suddenly we don't feel the same

25:10.717 --> 25:13.178
All I needed was to get it straight

25:13.261 --> 25:17.766
How I feel isn't complicated

25:17.849 --> 25:20.477
Everything that I long to be

25:20.560 --> 25:22.270
You and me

25:22.354 --> 25:24.898
There's more than meets the eye

25:24.981 --> 25:27.817
Everything that I long to be

25:27.901 --> 25:31.530
As in you and

25:31.613 --> 25:38.578
I'm wandering on the city harbour

25:38.662 --> 25:43.375
Now possibly I will see you

25:43.458 --> 25:45.627
In Watson

25:45.710 --> 25:48.338
Run away with me

25:48.421 --> 25:52.759
You're my West Coast problem

25:52.842 --> 25:55.262
Now, finally

25:55.345 --> 25:59.849
We are goin' home

25:59.933 --> 26:04.104
Once again, I lose it all

26:04.187 --> 26:06.898
Once again, I lose it

26:06.982 --> 26:10.485
Once again, I lose it

26:10.569 --> 26:15.615
Once again, I lose it all

26:15.699 --> 26:17.951
Begging for this love

26:18.034 --> 26:23.707
Once again, I lose it all
